  "label": "dog's favorite food is being washed",
  "description": "The text 'your dog's favorite food' is mapped onto the visual scene of a dog being washed with a hose. This creates an absurd and humorous contrast, implying that the dog's 'favorite food' is being subjected to a bath, which is not a food item but a cleansing activity. The mapping is based on the juxtaposition of the text with the visual material, where the dog is the central subject of both the text and the image, and the act of washing is humorously equated with the concept of 'favorite food'.",
